Package: stats2data
Title: Nonparametric Data Simulation from Reported Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-26
Authors@R: c(
    person(c("Sebastian", "A.", "J."), "Lortz", , "s.a.j.lortz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-0281-7996")),
    person(c("Marieke", "E."), "Timmerman", role = "ctb"),
    person("Don", "van Ravenzwaaij", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Simulates complete raw data sets from reported summary statistics,
    for cases where the original data are unavailable. The data are generated
    nonparametrically by simulated annealing so that they reproduce reported
    means and standard deviations, correlations and regression coefficients, or
    cell means and F-values of factorial ANOVA designs. Integer-valued data are 
    supported, and a 'shiny' application provides a graphical interface.
